<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1497529942"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1744128795"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="ネオネオン"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="DECO*27 / 初音ミク"/><amll:meta key="album" value="アンデッドアリス"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:05.957"><div begin="00:00.175" end="03:00.107"><p begin="00:00.175" end="00:00.175" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">廻るネオネオン<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">霓虹灯流光溢彩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi ： DECO* 27</span></p><p begin="00:00.175" end="00:06.258" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">こんなことならホントのことを言え<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi ： DECO* 27</span></p><p begin="00:06.733" end="00:07.199" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">ばよかった</p><p begin="00:07.790" end="00:12.768" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">でもでも君のためなら嘘もつけるん<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可如果这一切都是为了你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">de mo de mo ki mi no ta me na ra</span></p><p begin="00:13.148" end="00:14.327" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">だと光っていたかった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要就此绽放光芒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi ka 't te i ta ka 't ta</span></p><p begin="00:15.060" end="00:15.813" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">「ごめんね」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“我很抱歉”“我很抱歉”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 go me n ne 」「 go me n ne 」</span></p><p begin="00:30.206" end="00:32.490" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">例えば僕が君のことを飽きちゃうな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">假如我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta to e ba bo ku ga</span></p><p begin="00:32.609" end="00:32.942" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">んて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">假如从今往后</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta to e ba ko no sa ki zu 't to</span></p><p begin="00:33.485" end="00:36.209" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">例えばこの先ずっと一緒にいれない<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta to e ba ko no sa ki zu 't to</span></p><p begin="00:36.597" end="00:36.882" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">なんて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们没有办法在一起了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so n na a ri e na i ko to</span></p><p begin="00:37.576" end="00:39.244" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">そんなありえないこと有り得ないじ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那种事根本就不会发生</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so n na a ri e na i ko to</span></p><p begin="00:39.593" end="00:39.693" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">ゃない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那不是不可能的吗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sho u ha i ha i tsu mo</span></p><p begin="00:40.110" end="00:43.041" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">勝敗はいつも愛が勝って僕が負ける<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">胜负不论何时</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sho u ha i ha i tsu mo</span></p><p begin="00:43.584" end="00:44.163" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">それでいいのに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明那就是最好的结果</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re de i i no ni</span></p><p begin="00:45.195" end="00:47.132" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">例えば譲れない正義がお互いにあっ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">举例来说 我们各自都怀揣着</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta to e ba yu zu re na i se i gi ga</span></p><p begin="00:47.676" end="00:47.936" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">て<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无法妥协的正义吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta to e ba 「 go me n ne 」 wo</span></p><p begin="00:48.446" end="00:50.402" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">例えば「ごめんね」を言ったほうが<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若是要将错误</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta to e ba 「 go me n ne 」 wo</span></p><p begin="00:51.002" end="00:51.504" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">悪いのならば<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">归咎于说“对不起”的那个人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i 't ta ho u ga wa ru i no na ra ba</span></p><p begin="00:52.124" end="00:54.854" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">僕は何度だって悪魔になって謝るよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那我会无数次</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ha na n do da 't te</span></p><p begin="00:55.891" end="00:58.160" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">君がありのままの笑顔でいてくれる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要能够让你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ga a ri no ma ma no</span></p><p begin="00:58.601" end="00:59.093" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">のなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">霓虹灯流光溢彩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma wa ru ne o ne o n</span></p><p begin="01:00.011" end="01:00.900" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">廻るネオネオン<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若是早知如此的话 将真心话直接说出口就好了啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma wa ru ne o ne o n</span></p><p begin="01:02.027" end="01:05.215" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">こんなことならホントのことを言え<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若是会沦落至此</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko n na ko to na ra</span></p><p begin="01:05.762" end="01:06.335" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">ばよかった</p><p begin="01:06.697" end="01:11.835" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">でもでも君のためなら嘘もつけるん<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可如果这一切都是为了你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">de mo de mo ki mi no ta me na ra</span></p><p begin="01:12.233" end="01:13.692" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">だと光っていたかった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要就此绽放光芒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi ka 't te i ta ka 't ta</span></p><p begin="01:14.498" end="01:15.030" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">「ごめんね」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“我很抱歉”“我很抱歉”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 go me n ne 」「 go me n ne 」</span></p><p begin="01:29.178" end="01:31.482" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">例えば治しきれない傷を付けちゃっ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若是就此留下了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta to e ba na o shi ki re na i ki zu wo</span></p><p begin="01:31.866" end="01:32.299" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">たって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">难以治愈的伤</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu ke cha 't ta 't te</span></p><p begin="01:32.749" end="01:35.595" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">例えばそれを思い出と言える関係で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若那是一段</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta to e ba so re wo</span></p><p begin="01:36.255" end="01:38.497" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">痛くないと言ってただ笑えばいい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要能笑着说我不觉得痛苦就可以了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ta ku na i to i 't te ta da wa ra e ba i i</span></p><p begin="01:39.247" end="01:41.789" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">そうやって好きな形にして愛でるこ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像这样将其塑造成自己喜欢的模样</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so u ya 't te su ki na ka ta chi ni shi te</span></p><p begin="01:42.107" end="01:43.002" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">とは我儘かな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">然后加以呵护是种任性吗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me de ru ko to ha wa ga ma ma ka na</span></p><p begin="01:44.361" end="01:46.951" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">例えば僕は君の全部を知らないよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">假如说我对你的一切一无所知</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta to e ba bo ku ha ki mi no ze n bu wo shi ra na i yo</span></p><p begin="01:47.454" end="01:50.527" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">例えば僕は君の理想にはなれないよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">假如我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta to e ba bo ku ha</span></p><p begin="01:51.022" end="01:51.973" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">そんなもんだろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">其实就是如此吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so n na mo n da ro u</span></p><p begin="01:52.949" end="01:53.441" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">予想していただろう？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">其实都在意料之中吧?</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo so u shi te i ta da ro u ?</span></p><p begin="01:53.973" end="01:56.295" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">どうやって 君がしたいことそのす<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我该怎么做</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do u ya 't te</span></p><p begin="01:56.829" end="01:57.493" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">べてに答えればいいんだろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">全都好好作出回应呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ta e re ba i i n da ro u</span></p><p begin="01:58.813" end="02:01.746" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">君のいやなとこ 僕のいやなとこ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的那些缺点 我的那些短处</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no i ya na to ko bo ku no i ya na to ko</span></p><p begin="02:02.477" end="02:05.070" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">なんだってこんなに知っちゃったん<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何我们彼此</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n da 't te ko n na ni</span></p><p begin="02:05.321" end="02:05.636" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">だろうな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都是如此了若指掌呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o wa ri ga ku re ba su be te mu da da to</span></p><p begin="02:06.122" end="02:09.005" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">終わりが来ればすべて無駄だと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">待到终焉来临时一切都会沦为徒劳</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o wa ri ga ku re ba su be te mu da da to</span></p><p begin="02:09.932" end="02:12.210" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">僕は死んだって言えやしないんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这样的话哪怕到死我都不会说出口来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ha shi n da 't te i e ya shi na i n da</span></p><p begin="02:13.272" end="02:14.611" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">廻るネオネオン<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">霓虹灯流光溢彩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma wa ru ne o ne o n</span></p><p begin="02:15.202" end="02:18.865" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">こんなことならホントのことを言え<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若是会沦落至此</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko n na ko to na ra</span></p><p begin="02:19.350" end="02:19.954" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">ばよかった</p><p begin="02:20.777" end="02:25.623" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">でもでも君のためなら嘘もつけるん<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可如果这一切都是为了你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">de mo de mo ki mi no ta me na ra</span></p><p begin="02:26.117" end="02:27.410" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">だと光っていたかった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要就此绽放光芒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi ka 't te i ta ka 't ta</span></p><p begin="02:30.079" end="02:32.300" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">「ごめんね」</p><p begin="02:46.984" end="02:49.184" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">例えば君が君の鼓動をやめちゃうな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">假如你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta to e ba ki mi ga</span></p><p begin="02:49.584" end="02:49.943" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">んて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">假如我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta to e ba bo ku ga</span></p><p begin="02:50.543" end="02:52.826" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">例えば僕が僕の呼吸をやめちゃうな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">要让自己就此不再呼吸</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta to e ba bo ku ga</span></p><p begin="02:52.826" end="02:53.357" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54">んて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那种事根本就不会发生</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so n na a ri e na i ko to</span></p><p begin="02:54.028" end="02:55.918" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L55">そんなありえないこと有り得ないじ<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so n na a ri e na i ko to</span></p><p begin="02:56.155" end="02:56.337" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L56">ゃない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那不是不可能的吗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sho u ha i ha i tsu mo</span></p><p begin="02:56.610" end="02:59.427" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L57">勝敗はいつも愛が勝って僕が負ける<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">胜负不论何时</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sho u ha i ha i tsu mo</span></p><p begin="02:59.931" end="03:00.107" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L58">それでいいのに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明那就是最好的结果</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re de i i no ni</span></p></div></body></tt>